WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.869
I want you to close your eyes and think of a memory that makes you happy.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.809
Now, think of a memory you associate with your youth.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:26.939
Now consider the most painful memory of your life, now open your eyes.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:35.010
This device extracts the actual memory from your brain and displays it before you

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:41.189
The machine...is incredible. Pure unfiltered truth.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.160
This is a terrible loss.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.760
I just wanted to say how truly sorry I am.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:56.060
How did you know Gordon?

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:56.660
He saved my life.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.940
He was found dead in his office with gunshots in the wall.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:01.700
Gunshots.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.020
No bullet wounds.

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.720
He was working with a lot of troubled people.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:09.240
We need to find out what happened to you, Gordon. It's the least I could do.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.709
They can't see your memories, but I could see the memories of those near you

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.340
Who are you?

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:19.660
I'm working for his widow. I know you saw him that night.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:21.240
I Ioved him.

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:27.860
- Can I help you? 
- Yes. Alison? 
- Alison is Dead.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.260
You think they're hiding something?

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:34.900
- There are people looking for you, if - 
- A man has been murdered...got bigger things to worry about.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.640
Word cannot get out about Gordon's death.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:42.729
- What do you want from me? 
- I want to ask you questions about Gordon --
- Get out!

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:47.180
The mind forgets things for a reason.

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:49.600
There are adverse affects to the machine -- time collapse, hallucinations

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:51.314
Do you know who this is?

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.520
Lawton has been lying.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.340
I think I know who killed Gordon.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:58.780
I would hate if I found out that you are lying.

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.340
You have something you wish you could forget.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.140
Who are you?

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.140
Put it down. Put it down!

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.640
Help me!

